\section Core_intro_files Source files

| File | Content |
|---|---|
| cluster_identifier.py | the polarity index, the \ref py_utils::core::cluster_identifier::Population "Population" and the \ref py_utils::core::cluster_identifier::ClusterIdentifier "ClusterIdentifier" |
| edge_classes.py | the ten edge classes and their stoichiometric contracts |
| rag.py | the Edge family and the \ref py_utils::core::rag::ReactionAdmissibilityGraph "ReactionAdmissibilityGraph" container |
| graph_walker.py | the \ref py_utils::core::graph_walker::GraphWalker "GraphWalker", which assembles the right-hand side |
| state_layout.py | the \ref py_utils::core::state_layout::StateLayout "StateLayout", which maps vertices to ODE indices |
| to_networkx.py | export of a declared graph for structural diagnostics |
| reductions/bin_moment.py | the logarithmic bin-moment reduction |
| reductions/he_reduction.py | the two helium-occupancy reductions |

\sa \ref Materials_intro, \ref Solver_intro

*/
